          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n1. The applicant should be a permanent resident of Haryana.\n1. The applicant should have a valid Family ID Card (Parivar Pehchan Patra).\n1. The applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste category.\n1. The applicant&#39;s age should be 18 years or above.\n1. Subsidy will be provided on lease money from 2nd to 5th year of lease.\n1. The maximum area eligible for subsidy is 4 hectares per applicant.\n1. The subsidy is applicable only on Panchayati ponds and government water sheds.\n\n<br>\n\n"
        },
        "schemeContent": {
          "benefitTypes": {
            "id": 1,
            "label": "Cash",
            "value": "cash"
          },
          "benefits": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Financial Assistance:",
                  "underline": true
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
